{%- comment -%}
  structured-data.liquid — Shopify-native Product & Article schema ONLY.

  Phase A dedup: removed the duplicate WebSite entity (canonical source is now
  snippets/tbk-schema-website.liquid) and the duplicate BreadcrumbList
  (canonical source is now snippets/tbk-schema-breadcrumb.liquid).
  This snippet is retained because it is the ONLY source of Shopify's native
  Product/Article structured data, which those two snippets do not provide.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'product' -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    SEO-023: sections/main-product.liquid (templates/product.hampers-template.json) carries its own
    hand-rolled Product schema with fields this native filter doesn't emit (sku, category, seller,
    shippingDetails, hasMerchantReturnPolicy) - genuinely valuable for Merchant Center. Skip the
    native block only there to avoid two @type:Product entities describing the same URL; every
    other product template relies on this native block alone.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- unless template.suffix == 'hampers-template' -%}
    <script type="application/ld+json">{{ product | structured_data }}</script>
  {%- endunless -%}
{%- elsif request.page_type == 'article' -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ article | structured_data }}</script>
{%- elsif request.page_type == 'search' -%}
  {%- render 'tbk-schema-search' -%}
{%- endif -%}
